{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-2","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","englishTitle":"If a first magnitude be the same multiple of a second that a third is of a fourth, and a fifth also be the same multiple of the second that a sixth is of the fourth, the sum of the first and fifth will also be the same multiple of the second that the sum of the third and sixth is of the fourth.","book":5,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","contentId":"euclid-5-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e65257c54b2245df31043170dc3d085342124dc4d6bd9ae660216e1bb631afcf","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-2.statement","euclid-5-2.construction.1","euclid-5-2.proof.1","euclid-5-2.proof.2","euclid-5-2.proof.3","euclid-5-2.proof.4","euclid-5-2.conclusion","euclid-5-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6e4f360f80f2700842dc67dff4cc9961d09a8853bf247c949eba05230094bef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a first magnitude be the same multiple of a second that a third is of a fourth, and a fifth also be the same multiple of the second that a sixth is of the fourth, the sum of the first and fifth will also be the same multiple of the second that the sum of the third and sixth is of the fourth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果第一个等同于第二个等同的乘数,即第三个等同的乘数,而另一个等同于第二个等同的乘数,则第一个和第五等同于第二个等同的乘数,即第三个和第六等同于第四个等同的乘数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b36a022ca4aefcc437820d0d1c52c1a81d7070258cacb86fe0a882ed434214c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a first magnitude, AB, be the same multiple of a second, C, that a third, DE, is of a fourth, F, and let a fifth, BG, also be the same multiple of the second, C, that a sixth, EH, is of the fourth F; I say that the sum of the first and fifth, AG, will be the same multiple of the second, C, that the sum of the third and sixth, DH, is of the fourth, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一级,即AB, 与第二个,C相同, 第三个,DE, 第四个, F, 第五, BG, 也是第二个, C, 第六, EH, 第四个, F; 我说, 第一和第二个, AG, 的总和, 将是第二个, C, 第三和第四个, DH, 的同数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f406d9bc2fcb984f3c1d2406fbd805d8d47c4adb36af1dbd14637802e5b7075","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is the same multiple of C that DE is of F, therefore, as many magnitudes as there are in AB equal to C, so many also are there in DE equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB是C的倍数,DE是F,因此,AB的数值等于C,C的数值也等于F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58bf737b7ef1788f6e9a46ed14424b713bf5310e28927ca3105397e21e142e18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as many as there are in BG equal to C, so many are there also in EH equal to F; therefore, as many as there are in the whole AG equal to C, so many also are there in the whole DH equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,BG的这一数字相当于C,EH的这一数字也相当于F;因此,AG的总数相当于C,DH的总数也相当于F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"340fefc494c194b03bf3d7c0630d01c6a0f02431410ecdd83597067bf1e1a487","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever multiple AG is of C, that multiple also is DH of F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论AG的乘数是C, F的乘数也是DH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f135f42bb953d78a566f72c38676dd56b0fc0849f3877d9633bc4977a73301c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the sum of the first and fifth, AG, is the same multiple of the second, C, that the sum of the third and sixth, DH, is of the fourth, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,第一和第二组的AG和C的总数与第三组和第六组的DH和第四组的F相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21be66812f67ecf87f8d0fb1e262b9da79829a6f545892c543584301cbff38f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q.E.D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等Q.E、D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-2.source","contentId":"euclid-5-2","revisionId":"euclid-5-2@raw-e65257c54b2245df","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"003ddec384c66bc49286ca4ac4740e3193b44506161a7ee2806027cd3d1deb33","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-3:euclid-5-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-3.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"V. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-6:euclid-5-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-6.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"V. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-17:eu